---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="BuildSmart | JayTech9"
  description="Inventory, sales and accounting software for hardware stores and building material suppliers in Ghana, with Ghana VAT, NHIL and GETFund built in."
  ogType="article"
>
  <article>
    <header class="page-head">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="crumb">
          <a href="/work/">Work</a>
        </p>
        <h1>BuildSmart</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Inventory, sales and accounting software for hardware stores and building material suppliers in
          Ghana, with Ghana VAT, NHIL and GETFund built in.
        </p>
        <dl class="facts">
          <div>
            <dt>Client</dt>
            <dd>Our own product</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Status</dt>
            <dd>
              <span class="status" data-status="In development">
                In development
              </span>
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Year</dt>
            <dd>2026</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Built with</dt>
            <dd>Node.js, Express, PostgreSQL, Docker</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="wrap section case-body">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2 id="the-problem">The problem</h2>
        <p>
          Hardware stores and building material suppliers in Ghana often run on paper books, a spreadsheet and
          the owner’s memory. Stock goes missing without anyone noticing, quotations are rewritten by hand,
          and preparing VAT returns takes days.
        </p>
        <h2 id="what-were-building">What we’re building</h2>
        <p>
          BuildSmart is a cloud system that each store signs into with its own private account. One codebase
          serves many businesses, and every record is kept separate per business.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Stock that can’t quietly change.</strong> Every movement in or out is recorded as a
            permanent entry, so the stock count always has a history behind it.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Sales, purchases and supplier invoices</strong> in one place, with cancelled orders kept
            out of the financial totals.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Ghana taxes by default.</strong> VAT, NHIL and GETFund are applied automatically. The GRA
            tax report respects the date a business registered for VAT.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Four levels of access</strong>, so a cashier sees only what a cashier needs.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2 id="where-it-stands">Where it stands</h2>
        <p>
          The core backend is built and covered by more than 370 automated tests. Next on the roadmap are
          quotations, customer records, Paystack billing and the full web interface, ahead of pilots with
          partner stores.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
  <nav class="wrap next" aria-label="Next project">
    <p class="muted">Next project</p>
    <a href="/work/donation-management/">Donation management system</a>
  </nav>
  <section class="contact-band" aria-labelledby="contact-band-heading">
    <div class="wrap contact-band__inner">
      <div class="contact-band__text">
        <h2 id="contact-band-heading">Tell us what slows your business down</h2>
        <p>
          Start with a free 30-minute call. We’ll listen, suggest what would help, and send a written quote
          with a clear timeline.
        </p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button contact-band__primary" href="/contact/">
            Book a free call
          </a>
          <a class="button button--quiet contact-band__quiet" href="https://wa.me/233203651974">
            Chat on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <svg class="contours contact-band__art" viewBox="0 0 600 600" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <circle cx="40" cy="560" r="18" class="contours__dot"></circle>
        <path
          d="M 110 560 A 70 70 0 0 0 40 490"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--green"
          style="--delay:0ms"
        ></path>
        <path
          d="M 158 560 A 118 118 0 0 0 40 442"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
          style="--delay:70ms"
        ></path>
        <path
          d="M 206 560 A 166 166 0 0 0 40 394"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
          style="--delay:140ms"
        ></path>
        <path
          d="M 254 560 A 214 214 0 0 0 40 346"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--green"
          style="--delay:210ms"
        ></path>
        <path
          d="M 302 560 A 262 262 0 0 0 40 298"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
          style="--delay:280ms"
        ></path>
        <path
          d="M 350 560 A 310 310 0 0 0 40 250"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--blue"
          style="--delay:350ms"
        ></path>
        <path
          d="M 398 560 A 358 358 0 0 0 40 202"
          pathLength="1"
          class="contours__arc contours__arc--green"
          style="--delay:420ms"
        ></path>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .crumb {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .page-head h1 {
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
  .facts {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(11rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem 2rem;
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    display: grid;
  }
  .facts dt {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .facts dd {
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .facts .status {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
  }
  .case-body {
    padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  }
  .next {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-section);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }
  .next a {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .next a:hover {
    color: var(--blue);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .contours {
    width: 100%;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .contours__arc {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2.5px;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }
  .contours__arc--blue {
    stroke: var(--blue);
  }
  .contours__arc--green {
    stroke: var(--green);
    stroke-width: 4px;
  }
  .contours__dot {
    fill: var(--green);
  }
  .contours--animate .contours__arc {
    stroke-dasharray: 1;
    stroke-dashoffset: 1px;
    animation: 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.3, 0.6, 0.2, 1) forwards draw;
    animation-delay: var(--delay);
  }
  @keyframes draw {
    to {
      stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .contours--animate .contours__arc {
      stroke-dashoffset: 0;
      animation: none;
    }
  }
  .contact-band {
    background: var(--blue);
    color: var(--white);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .contact-band__inner {
    align-items: end;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    display: grid;
  }
  .contact-band__text {
    max-width: 34rem;
  }
  .contact-band h2 {
    max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .contact-band p {
    color: #dcecf5;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    margin-block: 1.25rem 2rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .contact-band__primary {
    background: var(--white);
    border-color: var(--white);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .contact-band__primary:hover {
    background: var(--paper);
    border-color: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .contact-band__quiet {
    color: var(--white);
    border-color: var(--white);
  }
  .contact-band__quiet:hover {
    background: var(--white);
    border-color: var(--white);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .contact-band .contact-band__art {
    display: none;
  }
  .contact-band .contact-band__art .contours__arc--blue {
    stroke: #4d9cc8;
  }
  @media (width>=52rem) {
    .contact-band__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    }
    .contact-band .contact-band__art {
      justify-self: end;
      max-width: 22rem;
      margin-bottom: -6rem;
      display: block;
    }
  }
</style>
